                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "I found out I was doing a wrong sequence `[count]v(textobj)` rather than `v[count][textobj]`, it's working fine now. And I can't even seem to reproduce the weird behavior with the former sequence. Thanks for the quick reply though. Should I delete this or just keep it?",
